<http://data.silknow.org/object/e4632e84-3115-383c-823a-e4b3b58b3c1c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Hat of stiffened silk gauze in black. The hat consists of a skull cap and a rounded vertical part at the back. The frames are made of lacquered bamboo splints, stiffened hanji paper and horsehair, which are then covered with silk gauze. Attached to the back are a pair of fan-shaped pennons, made of bamboo frames covered with silk gauze. The edging is made of laquered paper-string."@en , "Hat of stiffened silk gauze in black, with two pennons at the back"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/89ccfafa-8468-3bb3-a682-3072a25de22f> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/60268c8c-bf95-391c-831c-7167ad3b53ee> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/0445e969-ef5a-3ef2-9534-2c6d649577bb> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/cfe78c02-9915-345b-aa66-36ed0e8f311a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/6cf48e61-6ca7-34e5-b692-2e154209e721> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Hat of stiffened silk gauze in black, with two pennons at the back"@en , "Hat of stiffened silk gauze in black. The hat consists of a skull cap and a rounded vertical part at the back. The frames are made of lacquered bamboo splints, stiffened hanji paper and horsehair, which are then covered with silk gauze. Attached to the back are a pair of fan-shaped pennons, made of bamboo frames covered with silk gauze. The edging is made of laquered paper-string."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/e4632e84-3115-383c-823a-e4b3b58b3c1c/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/e4632e84-3115-383c-823a-e4b3b58b3c1c/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/e4632e84-3115-383c-823a-e4b3b58b3c1c/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/e4632e84-3115-383c-823a-e4b3b58b3c1c/dimension/3> ;
